sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor User
    participant Browser
    participant Django
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Sports as The Odds API
    participant GH as GitHub Actions

    Note over GH: Scheduled ~09:14 and ~19:14 ET

    GH->>GH: manage.py sync_nfl_data
    GH->>Sports: Fetch NFL games + spreads + scores
    Sports-->>GH: Sports data

    GH->>DB: Upsert Games
    GH->>DB: Create GameLine snapshots
    GH->>DB: Update scores / status

    GH->>GH: manage.py settle_games
    GH->>DB: Grade final / cancelled picks

    Note over User,Browser: User opens current week's games

    User->>Browser: View current week
    Browser->>Django: GET /games
    Django->>DB: Query upcoming games + current lines
    DB-->>Django: Games + lines
    Django-->>Browser: Render HTML
    Browser-->>User: Display games / spreads

    Note over User,Browser: User selects a team

    User->>Browser: Select team
    Browser->>Django: POST /games/{id}/pick

    Django->>DB: Begin transaction
    Django->>DB: Verify game not started
    Django->>DB: Verify no existing pick
    Django->>DB: Get current official GameLine
    Django->>DB: Create Pick
    DB-->>Django: Pick created
    Django-->>Browser: HTMX partial
    Browser-->>User: Pick locked

    Note over User,Browser: After kickoff

    User->>Browser: View pick history
    Browser->>Django: GET /history
    Django->>DB: Query picks + games + results
    DB-->>Django: Pick history
    Django-->>Browser: Render HTML
